summary:
  A drawing that is not a local file yet is read without its shape.

history:
  A station's logo is on the network until the logo cache has it, and
  for a station whose cache copy is broken it stays there. An SVG named so
  was drawn squeezed into the square meanwhile. Its shape is read off a copy
  of 16 pixels before the picture itself is asked for. This mutant never
  asks for that copy.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverImage.qml

find:
          source: CoverLogic.namedSvg(cover._address) ? cover.source : ""

replace:
          source: CoverLogic.namedSvg("") ? cover.source : ""

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_cover_larger_fetch.py::test_a_drawing_from_the_network_is_asked_for_its_shape_once.
  Line-neutral.
